# Signing

Do not put personal `DEVELOPMENT_TEAM` or personal Bundle IDs into `BrainRush.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj`.

- Shared default Bundle ID lives in `Config/Shared.xcconfig`: `com.jec.brainrush`
- Each developer keeps Team ID (and optional personal Bundle ID) in `Config/Local.xcconfig`
- `Config/Local.xcconfig` is gitignored. Never commit it.
- If a teammate hits "bundle identifier cannot be registered", tell them to set their own `PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER` in `Local.xcconfig`, not in `project.pbxproj`.
